BRIGHTFOLD DIGEST, ISSUE 42

Small tools that last

This week: why the tools we keep are the ones that do one thing, a visit to
a workshop that still repairs typewriters, and three readers' desks.

Read the full issue: https://brightfold.example/issues/42

